{"ID":"20251112111956-l9sgmqt","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251112111956-l9sgmqt","title":"UPL9-8——着色器优化","type":"doc","updated":"20251112160958"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112111956-sv0sdlf","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251112111956-sv0sdlf","updated":"20251112112058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251112112030-qiff7i4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112112030-qiff7i4","updated":"20251112112058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"前置知识："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240321152521-nkhbjzt","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"US——Unity Shader开发入门"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112112102-nuw9syi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251112112102-nuw9syi","updated":"20251112113310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"着色器优化的必要性"}]},{"ID":"20251112112113-qgrr0es","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112112113-qgrr0es","updated":"20251112113208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在开发时，为了快捷的实现对应的渲染效果，一些 Shader 制作者（程序、美术、技美等）会使用 Shader 可视化编辑器生成 Shader\n比如 Shader Graph、ASE(Amplify Shader Editor) 等，通过这些可视化编辑器生成的 Shader 的性能表现往往不是最优异的"}]},{"ID":"20251112113302-rx447pn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112113302-rx447pn","updated":"20251112113302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要原因："}]},{"ID":"20251112113208-e5gg1k0","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251112113208-e5gg1k0","updated":"20251112113218"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112113208-26szkl1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251112113208-26szkl1","updated":"20251112113210"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112113208-iw7x725","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112113208-iw7x725","updated":"20251112113210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Shader Graph、ASE 等工具为了适配各种情况，会生成比较通用的着色器代码，里面可能包含一些 冗余计算 或 不必要的分支"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112113208-qjopspa","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251112113208-qjopspa","updated":"20251112113208"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112113208-px6zj6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112113208-px6zj6r","updated":"20251112113208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"节点式编辑为了可读性，往往拆分为很多中间步骤，编译后可能比手写 Shader 冗长"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112113208-jtxyi49","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251112113208-jtxyi49","updated":"20251112113218"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112113208-lugex2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112113208-lugex2i","updated":"20251112113218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"手写 Shader 可以在指令级别做微调，比如合并数学运算、避免精度浪费，而可视化工具的优化程度受限"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112112113-gbqpjed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112112113-gbqpjed","updated":"20251112113230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此学习着色器优化的必要性就体现了出来，不管是对这些可视化编辑器生成的 Shader，还是我们自己通过代码编写的 Shader\n养成良好的优化习惯都是对项目有益处的，可以避免我们在Shader上浪费性能"}]},{"ID":"20251112112113-epw1r7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112112113-epw1r7b","updated":"20251112112113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"总结下 必要的原因："}]},{"ID":"20251112113234-domo709","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251112113234-domo709","updated":"20251112113255"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112113237-2ppj0nd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251112113237-2ppj0nd","updated":"20251112113237"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112113237-gir6edc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112113237-gir6edc","updated":"20251112113243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Shader 其实是 GPU 的核心工作单元"}]},{"ID":"20251112113245-n1acp2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112113245-n1acp2z","updated":"20251112113245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在移动设备或复杂场景中，Shader 性能的好坏直接决定了帧率"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112113237-vuy81nb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251112113237-vuy81nb","updated":"20251112113253"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112113237-fz30jvn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112113237-fz30jvn","updated":"20251112113253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即便是简单 Shader 效果，如果没有优化，可能会在像素填充、分支判断、纹理采样等环节造成额外开销，积少成多可能成为性能瓶颈"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112113237-aigfu53","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251112113237-aigfu53","updated":"20251112113255"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112113237-i6emqrt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112113237-i6emqrt","updated":"20251112113255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无论是用可视化编辑器生成，还是自己写，优化 Shader 都是开发者必备习惯，能够提升整个项目的可持续性"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112112113-ou36svb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112112113-ou36svb","updated":"20251112113258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过以上内容，足以说明 着色器优化的必要性"}]},{"ID":"20251112113304-26mp5vt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251112113304-26mp5vt","updated":"20251112113324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"着色器优化的主要优化方向"}]},{"ID":"20251112113318-a4gywuo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112113318-a4gywuo","updated":"20251112113322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"想要优化着色器，我们主要会通过以下几个方向去进行"}]},{"ID":"20251112113322-8sibeha","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251112113322-8sibeha","updated":"20251112113324"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112113322-ntouyv2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251112113322-ntouyv2","updated":"20251112113322"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112113322-23na0co","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112113322-23na0co","updated":"20251112113322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"降低计算量"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112113322-gofmdg2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251112113322-gofmdg2","updated":"20251112113322"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112113322-52z4sbv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112113322-52z4sbv","updated":"20251112113322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少采样开销"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112113322-4c0boyw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251112113322-4c0boyw","updated":"20251112113322"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112113322-f51yyjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112113322-f51yyjm","updated":"20251112113322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"降低填充率压力"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112113322-7ik9ycp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251112113322-7ik9ycp","updated":"20251112113324"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112113322-5zus438","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112113322-5zus438","updated":"20251112113324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"善用 GPU 并行特性"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112113320-9igd5ye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112113320-9igd5ye","updated":"20251112113320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]}]}